'''Lev''' can be found wandering about the middle of [[Canifis]]. Like many NPCs in Canifis, he will turn into a [[werewolf]] when attacked, unless the player is wielding a [[Wolfbane|Wolfbane dagger]]. He is normally aggressive when talking, but wearing a [[Ring of Charos]] causes him to be friendlier.

He cannot be killed as part of a werewolf [[slayer#Slayer Masters|slayer assignment]] in his human form.

